{
  "about": "Measured liquid heat capacities near 25 °C and heats of vaporization at the normal boiling point, transcribed from the NIST Chemistry WebBook (SRD 69) pages listed per component (opened 2026-10-01). Used by test/properties.test.js to compare the property records with measurements, independently of the sources the records were fitted to. Values exactly as printed on the WebBook pages; the person must compare each value with the page.",
